# TASK-0026C: snep/lib/Snep/CsvIE.php is legacy vendored-in code that has
# always used CRLF line endings (confirmed via git history -- untouched
# since the initial repository import). `-whitespace` disables
# `git diff --check`'s whitespace error detection for this one path only
# -- it does not normalize or convert the file's line endings (an
# `eol=crlf` attribute was tried first and rejected: it caused git to
# treat the whole file as changed on every diff, since the blob's
# internal storage vs. the attribute's requested checkout form disagreed
# -- far worse than the problem it was meant to solve). Without this,
# every native CRLF line adjacent to this task's own edits is flagged as
# "trailing whitespace", unrelated to the actual change.
snep/lib/Snep/CsvIE.php -whitespace
